  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summer Beach Getaway | Luxury 4BR Santa Rosa Beach Home | Sleeps 12<br><br>Walk to the beach from this luxury Santa Rosa Beach vacation rental.<br><br>Luxury Santa Rosa Beach Retreat | Sleeps 12 | Walk to Beach & 30A, Perfect for summer—4BR/4BA<br><br>The Home<br><br>Welcome to your luxury Santa Rosa Beach vacation rental, perfectly located on 30A, the beach, shopping, and dining. This spacious, thoughtfully designed home offers the ideal blend of upscale comfort and family-friendly living, making it perfect for large families, multi-family trips, or group getaways.<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements (Sleeps 12)<br><br>Designed for comfort and flexibility, the home includes:<br><br>3 King beds for restful, hotel-style sleep<br><br>Bunk room ideal for kids or teens. <br><br>Trundle bed that sleeps 2 + sleeper sofa queen size<br><br>Everyone has space to spread out while still enjoying time together.<br><br>Bathrooms (3 Full Baths, 1 Half Bath)<br><br>Enjoy 3 full bathrooms and 1 half bath, including 2 bathtubs and 3 showers—perfect for families with kids or guests looking to unwind after a long beach day.<br><br>Living Spaces<br><br>The open, stylish living room features plenty of comfortable seating, creating the perfect gathering space for movie nights, game time, or relaxing after a day on the Emerald Coast. The home’s calming coastal design creates a warm, welcoming atmosphere throughout.<br><br>Location, Location, Location<br><br>Step outside and enjoy:<br><br>Walk to the beach<br><br>Close proximity to 30A, shops, and restaurants<br><br>Easy access to biking, dining, and local attractions<br><br>This prime Santa Rosa Beach location lets you park the car and enjoy everything on foot.<br><br>Perfect For:<br><br>Families & multi-family vacations<br>Friend getaways<br>Beach lovers<br>Guests seeking luxury 30A accommodations<br><br>Sleeps 12 comfortably<br><br>4 bedrooms / 4 bathrooms<br><br>Walkable beach access<br><br>Upscale yet family-friendly<br><br>Prime Santa Rosa Beach / 30A location<br><br>Book now and experience one of the most comfortable and convenient Santa Rosa Beach vacation rentals—where luxury, family, location, and relaxation come together.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Santa Rosa Beach Luxury Home, 4BR/4BA, Sleeps 12, Golf Cart, Family Retreat"
        }
      ],
